# agentmoat: .gitignore
#
# Patterns to keep out of git. Grouped into:
#   1. Go-standard build/test artifacts.
#   2. Editor and OS clutter.
#   3. agentmoat-specific working files (build manifests, local audit logs).
#   4. Planning files that live alongside the repo but stay local-only.

# 1. Go build + test outputs
bin/
dist/
*.exe
*.test
*.out
*.prof
coverage.txt
vendor/

# Go modules cache stays in $GOPATH; nothing to ignore at the repo level.

# 2. Editor and OS files
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# 3. agentmoat working files
# Packer manifest output (post-processor "manifest" target).
build-manifest.json
# Per-user audit log written by `agentmoat apply` (see plan.md section 12.5).
.agentmoat/
# JSON artifacts copied from `make e2e` for manual replay.
.agentmoat-e2e/
# Packer scratch and validation artifacts.
packer/.packer.d/
packer/*.log

# 4. Planning files (user requested these stay local-only)
# plan.md is the design document; plan-checklist.md is the running tracker.
# handoff-*.md are handoff prompts for the next AI agent.
# All useful while building but should not be committed.
plan.md
plan-checklist.md
handoff-*.md
